WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.780 --> 00:00:07.680
So what happened at Unite the Right 2?

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:11.100
A massive police presence escorted a handful
of white supremacists

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:13.240
through a Metro Station in Virginia.

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:14.560
Cameras were everywhere.

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:17.720
One guy was arrested for spitting on a Virginia
State police officer.

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:20.360
That was it right? That's it, go home.

00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:21.300
That's it?

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:23.680
After a short ride to D.C.,

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:27.620
a few Nazis actually showed their faces in
public.

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:30.200
A few hundred anti-fascists hid theirs.

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:33.190
Thousands of counter protestors from diverse
backgrounds

00:00:33.190 --> 00:00:36.360
rallied, chanted, and marched in the streets.

00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:38.460
Donald Trump, you can't hide.

00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:40.700
We charge you with genocide.

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:42.780
Racist cops, you can't hide.

00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:44.860
We charge you with genocide.

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:48.100
Ain't no power like the power of the people
'cause the power of the people don't stop.

00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:52.920
Some groups marched better than others.

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:07.700
Cameras were everywhere, some guy burned a
Nazi / Confederate flag hybrid

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:11.040
and this guy dressed up as Indiana Jones because Nazis.

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:13.940
As for the Right Wing protest, I have no idea
what they said

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:18.440
because they were completely drowned out by
loud boos and Game of Thrones references.

00:01:18.440 --> 00:01:21.260
Shame! Shame! Shame! Shame!

00:01:21.260 --> 00:01:24.980
As the rain fell on Lafayette Square the crowds
began to disperse.

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:29.800
Most counter protesters never ever saw anyone
from the far right at the rally.

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:33.479
I saw a few of them on their way out, it was
like a handful of people, that was it.

00:01:33.480 --> 00:01:35.700
They have a basic right to protest, we have
a right to protest,

00:01:35.700 --> 00:01:37.120
so we show up with more numbers.

00:01:37.120 --> 00:01:40.860
They can't put on a showing like they think
they can.

00:01:40.860 --> 00:01:43.580
I think that they are far outnumbered by the
American people.

00:01:43.580 --> 00:01:50.180
They're movement is basically just incredibly
weak and should stop, just stop being Nazis.

